{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f1042abb-911d-8263-8e08-36e8b589c37e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T12:05:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:02:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. [pause] I'm calling about a storm drain. The grate's frozen shut and the water's just spreading out across the whole intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Where is this, sir? Which intersection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 295 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill. Right at the corner there. [line breaks up] ...can you hear me? I've got bad reception in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up a little. I got 295 Eustis Avenue, Historic Hill. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. [sigh] And it's not even storming. It's been dry for days. It's just that drain, it's iced over and the water has nowhere to go, so it's running out into the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no storm, just the drain is frozen and the water's backing out into the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And the cars are crawling through it. Everybody's slowing down to a crawl, [crosstalk] somebody's going to spin out on it once it freezes again tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you cut out right there. Somebody's going to what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:03:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spin out. When it freezes over. [sigh] This isn't the first time I've watched this, you know. It just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me write that down. Water across the intersection, grate frozen, traffic slowing through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. So what I want to know is when somebody last came by to look at that drain. Has anybody been out there? Because it sure doesn't look like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see the service history from this screen, so I'll put the question in with the report and ask the crew supervisor to get back to you on when it was last checked. Is this the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0197. I'm not home, I'm sitting at the garage getting an oil change. [pause] They've got me in a waiting room with no heat, so, I'll be here a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no fun, it's cold out today. Okay, I have 401-555-0197. I'll mark it as a frozen drain with water in the roadway so it gets looked at today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd appreciate that. I just don't want to be calling about this again next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You should hear from someone about the last visit. Anything else I can note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Lynch. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
